{"version":"v0.9","updateComponents":{"surfaceId":"moon-mars","components":[{"id":"overview_title","component":"Text","text":"月球与火星","variant":"h1","styles":{"font-size":"48vp","font-weight":"bold","color":"#16181D","line-height":1.3,"text-align":"left"}},{"id":"overview_body","component":"Text","text":"月球是地球的天然卫星，火星是围绕太阳公转的行星。两者的地表和大气条件差异明显。","variant":"body","styles":{"font-size":"30vp","font-weight":"normal","color":"#343A40","line-height":1.5,"text-align":"left"}},{"id":"comparison","component":"Table","columns":["比较项","月球","火星"],"rows":[["平均半径","约 1,737 千米","约 3,390 千米"],["大气","极稀薄外逸层","稀薄，以二氧化碳为主"],["地貌","撞击坑与月海","撞击坑、火山与峡谷"]],"styles":{"width":"100%"}},{"id":"root","component":"Column","children":["overview_title","overview_body","comparison"],"styles":{"padding":"16vp","gap":"16vp","background-color":"#F1F3F5","border-radius":"20vp"}}]}}
{"version":"v0.9","updateComponents":{"surfaceId":"moon-mars","components":[{"id":"moon_title","component":"Text","text":"月球","variant":"h3","styles":{"font-size":"36vp","font-weight":"bold","color":"#16181D","line-height":1.3,"text-align":"left"}},{"id":"moon_image","component":"Image","url":"https://science.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/moon-1-jpeg.webp","description":"NASA 的月球、地球与太阳合成图","fit":"contain","variant":"mediumFeature","styles":{"width":"100%","aspect-ratio":"3/2","border-radius":"8vp"}},{"id":"moon_description","component":"Text","text":"NASA 的月球、地球与太阳合成图","variant":"body","styles":{"font-size":"26vp","font-weight":"normal","color":"#555D66","line-height":1.5,"text-align":"left"}},{"id":"moon_facts","component":"Text","text":"深色的月海是古老熔岩平原。缺少稠密大气意味着在月面活动时，需要设备提供呼吸和温度防护。","variant":"body","styles":{"font-size":"30vp","font-weight":"normal","color":"#343A40","line-height":1.5,"text-align":"left"}},{"id":"moon_source","component":"RichText","text":"<p>来源：<a href=\"https://science.nasa.gov/moon/\">NASA 月球资料</a></p>","linksEnable":true,"styles":{"width":"100%"}},{"id":"moon_panel","component":"Column","children":["moon_title","moon_image","moon_description","moon_facts","moon_source"],"styles":{"gap":"12vp"}},{"id":"mars_title","component":"Text","text":"火星","variant":"h3","styles":{"font-size":"36vp","font-weight":"bold","color":"#16181D","line-height":1.3,"text-align":"left"}},{"id":"mars_image","component":"Image","url":"https://assets.science.nasa.gov/content/dam/science/psd/mars/resources/detail_files/7/7668_Mars-viking-2-orbiter-global-view-partial-valles-marinares-PIA04304-full2.jpg/jcr:content/renditions/cq5dam.web.1280.1280.jpeg","description":"NASA 维京号轨道器拍摄的火星全球视图","fit":"contain","variant":"mediumFeature","styles":{"width":"100%","aspect-ratio":"3/2","border-radius":"8vp"}},{"id":"mars_description","component":"Text","text":"NASA 维京号轨道器拍摄的火星全球视图","variant":"body","styles":{"font-size":"26vp","font-weight":"normal","color":"#555D66","line-heig